<title>USA: LIPA board to meet Wednesday, Monday.</title>
<headline>LIPA board to meet Wednesday, Monday.</headline>
<dateline>GARDEN CITY, N.Y. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Long Island Power Authority said its board of trustees has scheduled its next two meetings for Wednesday, June 11, at 1400 EDT/1800 GMT, and Monday, June 16, at 1600 EDT/2000 GMT.</p>
<p>Both meetings will be held at the lower level Teleconference Room in the OMNI in Uniondale, N.Y.</p>
<p>LIPA has put forward a plan to borrow $7.7 billion to fund a partial takeover of the Long Island Lighting Co.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
